name:           haskoin-store
version:        1.16.7
synopsis:       Storage and index for Bitcoin and Bitcoin Cash
description:    An indexer for Bitcoin and Bitcoin Cash. It downloads blocks and mempool
                transactions from the peer-to-peer network, indexes the chain in RocksDB and
                the mempool in Redis, and serves a REST API with balances, transactions and
                unspent outputs of addresses and extended public keys, a Blockchain.info
                compatible API, and events over WebSockets. Redis also holds the balances of
                extended public keys, and lets several stores answer as one. See the README
                for installation and configuration.
category:       Bitcoin, Finance, Network
homepage:       https://github.com/jprupp/haskoin-store#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/jprupp/haskoin-store/issues
